But keep the cursor effect subtle.

14. Scroll behaviour

Use Lenis-style smooth scrolling.

Then combine:

GSAP

for:

timeline animation
pinning
frame sequences
text reveals
feather movement
parallax
Three.js

Only if you actually need:

3D feather
particles
volumetric atmosphere
interactive sound visualization

Don't use Three.js just because it sounds impressive.

A highly polished GSAP implementation can look more expensive than a mediocre WebGL implementation.

