18. The "billion-dollar" rule

There are three things you absolutely should NOT do:

❌ excessive gradients
❌ excessive glowing neon
❌ excessive animations

Instead:

Luxury = hierarchy + whitespace + typography + materiality + motion restraint.

Think:

Apple × Indian classical art × luxury editorial × peacock iridescence

—not—

gaming website × neon AI × random particles.

